<h1>Current Mac Desktop Lineup</h1>
<p>
  The iMac and Mac mini start with the M4 — a capable all-in-one and compact desktop for everyday use. The Mac mini and Mac Studio step up to M4 Pro and M4 Max for professional creative work, with the Mac Studio's M3 Ultra offering the most GPU cores and memory (up to 192 GB) of any current Mac. The Mac Pro still ships with the M2 Ultra; it matches the M3 Ultra on media engine count but trails on GPU architecture and NPU performance.
</p>

